Fellow Nethackers,
What do ya think?

Drow Elves!  Just like all those other useless humanoid races, BUT DEADLIER!
Just imagine all the intrinsics they could have...
	
	-cast darkness spell (reverse light)
	-levitate
	-stealth
	-dispel magic (if female) - i.e. cancellation
	-sleep resistance
	-magic resistance

Have all sorts of neat stuff like drow magic chain, bucklers,drow magic swords 
and scimitars, and awesome female wizards (because they rule drow society).
But the best reason!  A drow city (multiple level?) deep (very deep) under-
ground containing all sorts of neat stuff like summoned demons (which Drow 
high priestesses could summon) and really good spells the wizards could cast.
A problem of course would be that by the time a character would get down far 
enough meet them, they would have all sorts of intrinsics that drow could not
affect them much...Unless cancellation could be changed...Or intrinsics could 
be taken away (like gremlins do).

So much for inscribing the 'E' word!

There are several objects here. -more-

a blessed drow hand crossbow.
3 blessed poisoned drow hand crossbow bolts.
a blessed drow scimitar.
a blessed drow elven cloak.
a blessed suit of drow elven chain mail.
a drow amulet named House Do'Urden.
a blessed figurine of a large black cat named Guenhwyvar.

I guess you would have had to read 
TSR's _The_Dark_Elf_Trilogy_ by Bob Salvatore to really understand.
It was excellent reading.

OK everybody, get out your Fiend Folio's and dust 'em off. (p. 33)
